Common Type Telephone
    documentation 'The 10-digit telephone number, including the area code, for the person.
    string TelephoneNumber
        documentation 'The telephone number including the area code, and extension, if applicable.
        is required
        min length 1
        max length 24
    enumeration TelephoneNumberType
        documentation 'The type of communication number listed for an individual or organization.
        is part of identity
    integer OrderOfPriority
        documentation 'The order of priority assigned to telephone numbers to define which number to 
                      'attempt first, second, etc.
        is optional
        min value 1
    bool TextMessageCapabilityIndicator
        documentation 'An indication that the telephone number is technically capable of sending and 
                      'receiving Short Message Service (SMS) text messages.
        is optional